{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36187","headline":"袁明府以家醖寄余余以山梅答赠非唯四韵兼亦双关 · 方干","name":"袁明府以家醖寄余余以山梅答赠非唯四韵兼亦双关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"封匏寄酒提携远，织笼盛梅答赠迟。\n九度搅和谁用法，四边窥摘自攀枝。\n罇罍泛蚁堪尝日，童稚驱禽欲熟时。\n毕卓醉狂潘氏少，倾来掷去恰相宜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}